# Ballista: shoots a BOLT of light (ballistaBolt.pre) at the nearest demon (a shadow too) in its ARC - "Game/Ballista" "Arc (deg)"
# around its facing (the entity's -Z; placed in eighths of a turn, R turns the ghost) - one munition a bolt
# (StructureSystem::tickCannons). A gun like the Cannon: the same crew, munitions, turn and placement (one cell, on the
# ground, a road piece, a walkway deck or a ship rail tile). Spawned origin 1.1 over its stand.
# WALK-THROUGH like the Cannon: Layer Cable collides only with Projectile (its own bolt collides with the terrain only).
# SHAPE (a placeholder; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a big crossbow on a post - a wooden STOCK along -Z, the
# two ARMS of the bow across its front, the loaded BOLT on the stock - a thin wooden shaft with two fins
# (Models/emplacementParts.obj's BallistaShaft: a prefab's Scale is uniform) and a glowing tip at its front (the muzzle:
# tickCannons' muzzle height 0.45 / out 1.3, keep them in step), the CHARGE CRYSTAL at the back, on a post over a square
# base plate. The child pieces are render-only.
Prefab gameBallista
	Global true
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Pillar3
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.45 0.3 0.15
		Position 0 0.2 -0.2
		Rotation -90 0 0
		Scale 0.2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		ContactEvents true
		Layer Cable
		CollidesWith Projectile
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 1.1 1
	Component GameStructure
		MeleeRadius 1
